<!-- About -->
  <section id="about" class="pt-12 pb-24 px-6 bg-theme-bg-neutral1">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto">
      <!-- Constrain with centering -->
      <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
        <!-- Passionate Statement as Subheading -->
        <h2 class="heading-section text-theme-text-dark text-center">
          I am passionate about the role of the non-profit sector in bringing
          about social and economic justice.
        </h2>

        <!-- About text -->
        <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto text-theme-text-dark space-y-6 mb-12">
          <p>
            Charities, NGOs, social enterprises, research and advocacy
            organisations, and social movements play a vital role in championing
            and addressing people's needs where the state or the economy have
            failed them. <span class="para-emphasis"
              >I am committed to applying my skills and experience to enable
              them to do so more effectively and efficiently</span
            >
            .
          </p>

          <p>
            My academic and professional background is in the social sciences,
            particularly equality, gender justice, human rights and
            international development. <span class="para-emphasis"
              >I've worked with individual change-makers, organisations and
              networks spanning a huge diversity of social sectors and issues
              nationally and internationally</span
            >.
          </p>

          <p>
            Over the last 20 years, I have garnered <span class="para-emphasis"
              >360° lived experience of non-profits</span
            >: as an employee and manager within the sector, as a consultant to
            the sector, and as a Charity Trustee.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Logos Grid -->
        <div>
          <div class="mb-12">
            <h3 class="text-theme-text-dark text-center">
            A sample of the organisations I've worked with, and for:
